L277:    that are prefixed with any of the subdirectories in SUBDIRS.  That
L278:    is, for a string S in MATCHES, its dirname must end with one of the
L279:    elements in SUBDIRS.  For instance, if subdir=foo/bar, that will
L280:    match a string foo/bar/baz or /some/texmf/foo/bar/baz.
